{"seq":40,"slug":"solidity-smart-contracts","title":"Solidity 智能合约语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Solidity 智能合约语言\n\nSolidity 是一门为以太坊虚拟机（EVM）而生的语言。它的每一个设计取舍——为什么没有浮点数、为什么 `storage` 和 `memory` 要显式区分、为什么一次外部调用就能让你倾家荡产——都只有放回 EVM 这台「世界计算机」的约束里才讲得通。这个 hub 不把 Solidity 当成又一门花括号语言来教语法，而是沿着「代码部署上链后不可更改、每条指令都要付费、任何人都能调用你的函数」这三条铁律，把语言、安全与工程实践串成一条因果链。\n\n整个 hub 分四条主线，层层递进。\n\n第一条主线是**基础**：先回答「为什么需要一门专门的语言」，再拆开 EVM 的执行模型——栈、内存、存储、gas、调用类型，最后把这些底层概念收束成一份合约源码的骨架。没有这层地基，后面所有关于存储布局和 gas 的讨论都会悬空。\n\n第二条主线是**语言核心**：把 Solidity 当作一门类型语言来精读。类型系统如何映射到 256 位的存储槽、函数的可见性与状态可变性如何编码进 ABI、继承与库如何在没有运行时多态开销的前提下复用代码。这一层把基础里的抽象落成可写的语法。\n\n第三条主线是**安全与 Gas**：这是智能合约区别于一切传统软件的地方。代码上链即公开、即不可改、即直接管钱，于是漏洞不是 bug 而是被即刻套现的提款机。这条主线系统梳理常见漏洞、深挖重入这一最经典的攻击面与对应防护范式，再回到 gas——既是性能问题，也是安全问题（一笔交易的 gas 上限本身就是攻击者的杠杆）。\n\n第四条主线是**工程实践**：把前三条主线落到可交付的工程上。现代工具链（Foundry / Hardhat）如何用模糊测试和不变量测试逼出隐藏漏洞；如何在「代码不可改」的铁律下用代理模式实现可升级；以及社区沉淀出的 ERC 标准与设计模式如何让你站在巨人肩上而非重蹈覆辙。\n\n四条主线不是平行的章节，而是一条认知坡道：理解 EVM → 写对语法 → 防住攻击 → 安全交付。建议初学者顺序通读；有经验的工程师可直接跳到「安全与 Gas」和「工程实践」，但遇到存储布局、调用语义这类底层概念时，请回头查阅基础与语言核心两章——本 hub 内部用相对链接交叉引用，每个概念只在它的主篇深讲，其余各篇点到为止。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-solidity","title":"为什么有 Solidity","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/foundations/why-solidity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evm-execution-model","title":"EVM 执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/foundations/evm-execution-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-structure","title":"合约结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/foundations/contract-structure"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language","title":"语言核心","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/language","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"types-storage","title":"类型与存储布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/language/types-storage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functions-modifiers","title":"函数与修饰器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/language/functions-modifiers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inheritance-libraries","title":"继承与库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/language/inheritance-libraries"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"security","title":"安全与 Gas","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"common-vulnerabilities","title":"常见漏洞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/security/common-vulnerabilities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reentrancy-patterns","title":"重入与防护模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/security/reentrancy-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gas-optimization","title":"Gas 优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/security/gas-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tooling-testing","title":"工具链与测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/practice/tooling-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"upgradeable-contracts","title":"可升级合约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/practice/upgradeable-contracts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"standards-patterns","title":"标准与设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/solidity-smart-contracts/practice/standards-patterns"}]}]}